# The control for kitty-upload-cap-passed: an upload whose bytes reach its reservation exactly is accepted.
# Rule B2 (decided 2026-11-13) of upload-rules.md.
# spec: the kitty graphics protocol (sw.kovidgoyal.net/kitty/graphics-protocol, read 2026-11-13)
# covers: image.kitty
# 3 + 513 = 516 bytes, exactly the reservation; the bytes past the picture's 3 are ignored.
size 20 10
send "\e_Ga=t,f=24,s=1,v=1,i=1,m=1;/wAA\e\\"
send "\e_Gm=0;\e\\"
send "\e_Ga=p,i=1,C=1\e\\"
